<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est receipts 110,000, Wk ago 128,000, and Yr ago 104,000 head at interior Iowa Minn. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded steady to $0.50 lower than mid-session Tuesday. Trade was moderate for light to moderate demand and moderate offerings. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
